      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just kinda scared to go to the er if it's just hay fever lol. it's always been like this in the spring. my throat doesn't feel like it's closing or anything, it just feels a bit weird like i swallowed something hard. isnt it super common for allergies to make your throat feel scratchy or weird? if i just take a double dose of benadryl will that fix it?",
