      "content": "Mixing medications without medical guidance can be dangerous and unpredictable. Antihistamines are for symptom relief, not for guaranteeing a complete reversal of a developing reaction. If you are uncomfortable going to the ER, you should at least contact an urgent care clinic or a telehealth service for professional advice before taking more medication. If the hives spread rapidly or you have any trouble breathing, that is a medical emergency regardless of cost.",
